  \resources\RenamePC_AuthBodyText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏣᏤᎵ ᎢᎬᎾᏕᎾ ᏫᎦᎷᎬ ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏗ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏍᎩ ᎰᏪᎸᎦ ᏣᏕᎶᎰᎯᏍᏗᎢ ᏰᏣᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎭ ᏣᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏚᏙᎥᎢ.
  \resources\RenamePC_ACCESS_DENIED_ErrorText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎥᏝ ᏱᎬᏁᏟᏴᎾ ᎾᏍᎩ PC ᏚᏙᎥᎢ ᎯᎠ ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏗ ᎠᎬᏗᏍᎬᎢ.
  \resources\RenamePC_AAD_UPDATE_FAIL_ErrorText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: The PC name can’t be updated in Azure Active Directory.
  \resources\RemoveUser_HeaderText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏘᏍᎪᎸᏓ ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ?
  \resources\RemoveUser_GeneralErrorText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎧᎵᏬ ᎬᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᏗ ᏂᎨᏒᎾ ᎠᎦᏑᏰᏓ ᎬᏗᏍᎩ. ᎢᎦᏓ ᎨᏒ ᎬᏗᏍᎩ ᏚᏩᏟᏌᏅᎯ ᏱᏂᏕᎬᏁᏍᏗ ᎥᎿ ᎠᏠᏗᎢ.
  \resources\RemoveUser_DeleteUserButtonText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏘᏍᎪᎸᏓ ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎯ
  \resources\RemoveUser_BodyText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎧᎵᏬ ᎯᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᎬ ᎯᎠ ᏴᏫ ᎤᏚᏓᎸᏗ ᏂᎦᏓ ᏧᏓᏟᏌᏅᎯ ᏫᏙᏛᎲᏏ ᎯᎠ PC, ᎤᏠᏯᏍᏛ ᎢᏳᏓᎴᎩ ᏂᏕᎬᏅ ᎦᏍᎩᎶ ᎦᏚᎢ ᎤᎾᏤᎵ, ᎡᎳᏓᎪᏘ ᏫᏚᏢᏅ, ᏕᎪᏪᎳᏅ, ᏗᏓᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅ, ᏗᎧᏃᎩᏓ, ᎠᎴ ᏗᏐᎢ ᏗᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ. ᎯᎠ ᎦᏟᏌᏅ Ꮭ ᏱᏚᏍᏆᏂᎪᏔᏅ ᎠᎴ ᏳᏫᏚᎵᏏᏅᏔᏅ ᏄᏓᎴ ᏗᎪᏢᎢ, ᏯᏛᎿ ᏄᏓᎴ PC, ᏯᏥᏲᎱᏎᎸᎢ.
  \resources\RemoveUserLoggedIn_HeaderText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Ꮭ ᏰᎵ ᏱᎦᏴᏍᎪᎸᏗ ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏗ
  \resources\RemoveUserLoggedIn_BodyText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎯᎠ ᏴᏫ ᏚᏙᎥ ᏭᏬᏪᎶᏗ Ꮟ ᎧᎵᏬ ᏂᏗᎦᎬᎯᏍᎪᎸᏛᎾ ᎤᏩᏌ ᎤᏚᏓᎸᏗ ᎤᏤᎵᎢ. ᏱᎬᎭᏂᎩᏍᏓ PC ᎩᎳᏊᏴ ᏗᎦᎯᏄᎪᏫᏎᏗ.
  \resources\RemoveFamilyUser_HeaderText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Remove this family member from your device
  \resources\RemoveFamilyUser_BodyText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: If you remove this family member from this device, they’ll still be in your family group. We’ll just remove their data from this device, so make sure things like their desktop items, downloads, documents, photos, and music are backed up in another place. Newly added family members will no longer be able to sign in to this device automatically.
  \resources\RemoveExclusion_HeaderText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎯᎲᎾ ᏗᎦᎴᏅᏗᏍᎩ 
  \resources\RemoveExclusion_BodyText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎢᏙᏳᏍᎪᏅ ᏣᏚᎵᎠ ᏣᎲᏍᏗᎢ ᎯᎠ ᏗᎦᎴᏅᏗᏍᎩ? 
  \resources\RemoveDomainUser_HeaderText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎯᎲᎾ ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏗ
  \resources\RemoveDomainUser_DeleteUserButtonText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏅᏅᏓᎩ
  \resources\RemoveDomainUser_BodyText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎢᏳᏃ ᏯᏎᏒᎲᎢ ᎯᎠ ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏗ ᎬᏴᏍᏗ, ᎡᎵᏊ ᎠᏎ ᎦᏨᏙᏗ ᏂᎨᏒᎾ ᏱᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᏕᏣᏙᎥ ᏫᏦᏪᎶᏗᎢ ᎠᎭᏂ PC.
  \resources\RemoteDesktop_WindowTitle:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎦᏍᎩᎶᎩ ᎦᏚ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ
  \resources\RemoteDesktop_RegistryError_HeaderText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏗᏣᎦᏛᎲᎦ ᏚᎾᏙᎥᎢ ᏕᎪᏪᎸᎢ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ
  \resources\RemoteDesktop_RegistryError_BodyText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎪᎱᏍᏗᏃ ᏓᏓᎴᎦ ᎾᎯᏳ ᏦᎦᏁᏟᏔᏅᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎣᎩᏤᎲᏍᏗᎢ ᏣᏤᎵᎢ ᏚᎾᏙᎥᎢ ᏕᎪᏪᎸᎢ.
  \resources\RemoteDesktop_ProceedButtonText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᎠᎲᎸᏍᏗᎢ
  \resources\RemoteDesktop_NextButtonText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎪᎯᏳᏙᏗ
  \resources\RemoteDesktop_GenericError_HeaderText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎪᎱᏍᏗᏃ ᏓᏓᎴᎦ
  \resources\RemoteDesktop_GenericError_BodyText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏘᏍᏚᎲᎦ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎠᎴ ᎠᏏᏉ ᏥᎭᏁᏟᏓ.
  \resources\RemoteDesktop_EnableFirewallError_HeaderText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎦᏍᎩᎶᎩ ᎦᏚ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏣᏤᎵᎢ ᎠᏥᎳ ᎠᏐᏴᎢ ᎤᏐᎾᎳᏛᎢ
  \resources\RemoteDesktop_EnableFirewallError_BodyText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎯᏍᏚᎠ ᎠᏔᎳᏗᏍᏗᎢ 3389 ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᎵᏍᎪᏟᏙᏗ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎦᏍᎩᎶᎩ ᎦᏚ ᎤᎶᎯᏍᏗᎢ ᎥᎿ ᏣᏤᎵᎢ ᎠᏥᎳ ᎠᏐᏴᎢ.
  \resources\RemoteDesktop_DisableFirewallError_HeaderText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎪᎱᏍᏗ ᏓᏓᎴᎦ ᎾᎯᏳ ᏦᎦᏁᏟᏔᏅᎢ ᎣᎩᏍᏚᏗᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎦᏍᎩᎶᎩ ᎦᏚ ᎠᏥᎳ ᎠᏐᏴᎢ ᎠᏔᎳᏗᏍᏗᎢ
  \resources\RemoteDesktop_DisableFirewallError_BodyText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏲᎤᎸᏗ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎦᏍᎩᎶᎩ ᎦᏚ ᎾᎥ ᎠᏔᎳᏗᏍᏗ 3389 ᎥᎿ ᏣᏤᎵᎢ ᎠᏥᎳ ᎠᏐᏴᎢ.
  \resources\RemoteDesktop_CloseButtonText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎯᏍᏚᎲᎦ
  \resources\RemoteDesktop_CancelButtonText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎠᏎᏒᏗ
  \resources\RDP_ProtectAccount_SignInButtonText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏤᏅᏍᏗ ᎥᎿ ᏙᏙᎥᎢ-ᎪᏪᎶᏗᎢ ᏗᏑᏰᏍᏗ
  \resources\RDP_ProtectAccount_HeaderText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎠᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗ ᏣᏤᎵᎢ ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏙᏗᎢ
  \resources\RDP_ProtectAccountDenied_BodyText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎠᏎᎢ ᏱᏣᎪᏗ ᎠᏙᏗᎯᏗᏍᎩ ᏙᏳᎢ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᏗ ( ᎾᏍᎩ ᎢᏳᏍᏗ Windows Hello, ᎥᎧᏁᎬᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏗ ᎠᎴᏱᎩ PIN) ᎾᏍᎩ ᎬᏮᏙᏗ ᎯᎠ ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏙᏗ ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᏰᎵᎢ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᎯ ᎢᏳᎵᏍᏙᏗ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎦᏍᎩᎶᎩ ᎦᏚ.
  \resources\RDP_ProtectAccountAllowed_BodyText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏣᏤᎵᎢ ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏗᎢ ᎥᏝ ᎠᏎᎢ ᎠᏙᎯᏗᏍᎩ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏭᏙᏪᏕᏗᎢ ᎠᎭᏂ ᎯᎠ PC. ᎢᏳᏃ ᏰᎵᎢ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᎯ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎦᏍᎩᏕᎩ ᎾᏠᏯᏍᏛᎾ ᎠᏙᎯᏍᏗᏍᎩ, ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᎯᏍᏚᎢᎠ ᏣᏤᎵᎢ ᎠᎦᏙᎥᎯᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᏗᏍᎩ ᎥᎿ ᎠᎵᏍᎪᏟᏔᏅᎢ ᏂᎨᏒᎾ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎬᏩᏴᏍᏙᏗ.
  \resources\RDP_Enable_HeaderText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏰᎵᎢ ᎢᏯᏛᏁᎠ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎦᏍᎩᏕᎩ ᎦᏚ?
  \resources\RDP_Enable_Firewall_Part2_BodyText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎤᏁᏉᎥᎢ ᎠᏥᎳ ᎠᏐᏴᎢ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ
  \resources\RDP_Enable_Firewall_Part1_BodyText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏂᎯᏃ ᎯᏍᏚᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎦᏍᎩᎶᎩ ᎦᏚ ᎠᏔᎳᏗᏍᏗᎢ ᎥᎿᎢ ᏣᏤᎵᎢ ᎠᏥᎳ ᎠᏐᏴᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᎬᏮᏙᏗ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᏫᏗᎫᏓᎸᏗᎢ ᎠᎭᏂ ᎯᎠ PC. ᎢᏳᏃ ᏱᏣᏚᎵᎠ ᏩᎵᏍᏛᏍᎩ ᎢᏳᎵᏍᏙᏗ ᏫᏗᏚᏓᎸᏗᎢ ᎥᎿ ᏗᏑᏰᏓ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ, ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏓ  
  \resources\RDP_Enable_Firewall_Complete_BodyText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏂᎯᏃ ᎯᏍᏚᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎦᏍᎩᎶᎩ ᎦᏚ ᎠᏔᎳᏗᏍᏗᎢ ᎥᎿᎢ ᏣᏤᎵᎢ ᎠᏥᎳ ᎠᏐᏴᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᎬᏮᏙᏗ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᏫᏗᎫᏓᎸᏗᎢ ᎠᎭᏂ ᎯᎠ PC. ᎢᏳᏃ ᏱᏣᏚᎵᎠ ᏩᎵᏍᏛᏍᎩ ᎢᏳᎵᏍᏙᏗ ᏫᏗᏚᏓᎸᏗᎢ ᎥᎿ ᏗᏑᏰᏓ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ, ᏗᏣᏍᏚᎢᏍᏗ ᏧᏁᏉᎥᎢ ᎠᏥᎳ ᎠᏐᏴᎢ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ.
  \resources\RDP_Enable_BodyText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏂᎯ ᎠᎴ ᎠᏅᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᏑᏰᏍᏗ ᎭᏫᏂᏗᏢ ᎬᏗᏍᎩ ᏗᏚᏓᎸᏙᏗ ᎡᎵᏊ ᏳᎵᏍᏉ ᎫᏓᎳ ᎾᎾᎢ ᎯᎠ PC ᎢᏴᎢ ᎢᏗᏢ.
  \resources\RDP_Disable_HeaderText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎠᏲᎤᎸᏗ ᎦᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎦᏍᎩᏕᎩ ᎦᏚ?
  \resources\PBR_WipeData_DriveListLink\Content:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎬᏂᎨᏒᎢ ᏂᏛᎦ ᏕᎦᏅᏃᏛᎢ ᏗᏱᎸᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᏕᏯᏙᏔᏅᎢ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ
  \resources\PBR_UninstallWarning_Header:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Recent update
  \resources\PBR_UninstallWarning_Desc\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: This PC was recently updated. If you continue with Reset this PC, you won’t be able to undo the update.
  \resources\PBR_Title:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎢᎦᎧᎯᏴᏍᏗ ᎯᎠ PC
  \resources\PBR_SessionPreparation_Header:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎪᎱᏍᏗ ᏓᏛᏅᎢᏍᏗᏍᎬᎢ
  \resources\PBR_SessionPreparation_Desc\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎥᏝ ᎤᏟᏱᎪᎯᏓ ᏱᏗᎬᏟᎠᎵᏓ
  \resources\PBR_ResetTypeSelection_ResetOption_Desc:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏓᎲᏍᎪᎢ ᏂᎦᏓ ᏗᏣᏤᎵᎢ ᏓᏍᏆᏂᎪᏛᎢ, ᏗᎬᏙᏗ, ᎠᎴ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ.
  \resources\PBR_ResetTypeSelection_ResetOption:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏂᎦᎥᎢ ᎪᎱᏍᏗ ᎠᎲᏍᎪᎢ
  \resources\PBR_ResetTypeSelection_RefreshOption_Desc:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏓᎲᏍᎪᎢ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ, ᎠᏎᏅ ᏕᎤᎰᎢ ᏗᏣᏤᎵᎢ ᏓᏍᏆᏂᎪᏛᎢ.
  \resources\PBR_ResetTypeSelection_RefreshOption:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏕᏣᎮᏍᏗ ᏗᏆᏤᎵᎢ ᏓᏍᏆᏂᎪᏛᎢ
  \resources\PBR_ResetTypeSelection_Header:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎠᏑᏰᏍᏗ ᎠᏑᏯᎩᏍᏗ
  \resources\PBR_ResetOptions_SummaryLine\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏃᏊ ᏥᎩ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ:
  \resources\PBR_ResetOptions_Header:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎧᏁᏉᏍᏓᏅ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ
  \resources\PBR_ResetOptions_AdvancedOptions:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎯᏁᏟᏴᎾ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ
  \resources\PBR_ResetCancellation_Header:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Canceling
  \resources\PBR_ResetCancellation_Desc\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: This won’t take long
  \resources\PBR_Reset:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎢᎦᎪᏗ
  \resources\PBR_RemovedAppsList_Header:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᎲᏓ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ
  \resources\PBR_RemovedAppsList_Desc\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏥᏂᎲᏅᏓ ᎤᎪᏗᏗ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ Store ᏂᏙᏓᏳᏓᎴᏅᎢ, ᎠᏎᏃ ᎠᏎᎢ ᏙᏣᏘᏅᏗᏍᏗ Ꮎ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎤᏂᎳᏛᎢ ᎠᎴ ᎦᏘᏅᏛᏍᏗ ᎠᏠᏗ. ᎯᎠ ᏕᎦᏅᏅᏛ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᎵᏏᏂᏓᏅ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎦᏍᎩᎶᎩ ᎦᏚ ᎣᏂ ᏥᏙᎯᎧᎲᎦ.
  \resources\PBR_Note\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Note:
  \resources\PBR_MultipleUsersWarning_Header:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎠᏂᏐᎢ ᏴᏫ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᏂᏴᏢᎢ ᎠᎭᏂ PC
  \resources\PBR_MultipleUsersWarning_Desc\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏣᏚᎵᏧ ᏣᎯᎸᏍᏗᎢ? ᎯᎠᏃ ᏱᎬᏂᏌ ᎠᎵᏏᏅᏔᏅᎢ ᎦᏟᏌᏅᎢ ᏲᏲᎱᏌ.
  \resources\PBR_MeteredDataWarning_Format:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Cloud download can use more than 4 GB of data. Your connection is metered and charges may apply.
  \resources\PBR_LearnMore_Text\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Learn more about reset this PC
  \resources\PBR_HelpToChoose\Content:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Help me choose
  \resources\PBR_FinalPreparation_Header:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏗᎭ ᏥᏙᎯᎧᎲᎦ
  \resources\PBR_FinalPreparation_Format:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏄᏛᎿᏕᎬ: ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏗᎭ – %d%%
  \resources\PBR_FinalPreparation_Finalize:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏗᎭ ᏥᎭᏂᎩᏍᏓ
  \resources\PBR_FinalPreparation_Desc\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎯᎠ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ ᎤᏩᏌᏊ ᏥᎭᏂᎩᏍᏓ
  \resources\PBR_FinalPreparation_CloudFormat:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏄᏛᎿᏕᎬ: ᎡᎳᏓᎪᏘ ᎦᏢᏍᎬᎢ- %d%%
  \resources\PBR_Error_Header:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᏓᏓᎴᎬ ᎥᏂᎩᏍᏗᎲᎢ ᏣᏤᎵᎢ PC
  \resources\PBR_Error_Desc\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎥᏝ ᏱᏓᏂᏁᏟᏴᎾ.
  \resources\PBR_ErrorWindowsToGo_Desc\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏣᏤᎵᎢ PC ᎥᏝ ᏱᏙᎬᎧᎯᏴᎾ ᏂᏗᎦᎵᏍᏙᏗᎭ ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᎠᎢᏒᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎬᏗ Windows ᎡᏅᏍᏗ.
  \resources\PBR_ErrorSafeMode_Header:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎯᎠᏃ ᏥᏄᏍᏗ ᎥᏝᏃ ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᏱᎩ ᎥᎿ ᎠᎦᏎᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᎬᏙᏗ
  \resources\PBR_ErrorSafeMode_Desc\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᎢᎦᎧᎯᏴᏍᏗ ᎯᎠ PC, ᎠᏂᎩᏍᏙᏗ Windows ᏥᏅᏛᏁᎰᎢ ᎠᎴ ᎠᏏᏊ ᎢᎠᏁᏟᏙᏗ, ᎠᎴᏱᎩ ᎡᏅᏍᏗ ᎥᎿ ᎤᏁᏉᎥᎢ ᎠᏂᎩᏍᏙᏗᎢ ᎠᎴ ᎠᏑᏰᏍᏗ ᎣᏁᏍᏓᏱᎬᏁᏗ ᎠᏛᏛᎮᎸᎥᏍᎩ.
  \resources\PBR_ErrorRedirectedProfiles_Header:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎥᏝ ᏱᎬᏰᎦᎲᎯᏴᎾ ᎯᎠ PC ᎠᎴ ᏂᏗᎬᏩᏍᏗ ᏗᏣᏤᎵᎢ ᏓᏍᏆᏂᎪᏛᎢ
  \resources\PBR_ErrorRedirectedProfiles_Desc\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᎢᎦᎧᎯᏴᏍᏗ ᎯᎠ PC, ᎠᎴ ᏂᏙᎬᏩᏍᏗ ᏗᏣᏤᎵᎢ ᏓᏍᏆᏂᎪᏛᎢ, ᎾᏍᎩ ᎬᏅᏗᏍᎩ, ᎤᏙᏢᏒᎢ ᏓᏍᏆᏂᎪᏛᎢ, ᎠᎴ Windows ᏗᎪᏪᎵ ᎠᏎᎢ ᎤᏠᏱ ᎠᏱᎸᏍᏗᎢ ᎢᏧᎵᏍᏙᏗ. ᎠᎴ ᏴᎭᏑᏰᎩ ᎢᏣᎧᎯᏴᏍᏗᎢ ᎯᎠ PC ᎠᎴ ᎠᏏᎸᏍᏗ ᏂᎦᎥᏊ ᎪᎱᏍᏗ ᎠᎲᏍᏗ, ᎠᏎᏃ ᎢᎬᏱᏱᎢ ᏙᏣᏏᏅᏍᏙᏗ ᏨᏌ ᏗᏣᏤᎵᎢ ᏓᏍᏆᏂᎪᏛᎢ.
  \resources\PBR_ErrorPayloadVersionMismatch_Desc\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Download is invalid. Try again and select the local reinstall option.
  \resources\PBR_ErrorPayloadDownload_Desc\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: The download was interrupted. Check your connection and try again, or select the local reinstall option.
  \resources\PBR_ErrorPayloadConnection_Desc\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Unable to connect to the server. Check your connection and try again, or select the local reinstall option.
  \resources\PBR_ErrorNotSupportedInEdition_Desc\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: This edition does not support the selected recovery option. Try again with a different option.
  \resources\PBR_ErrorNoRecoveryEnv_Header:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎥᏝ ᏱᎬᏴᏩᏔ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎢᎠᎩᏏᏐᏗ ᏄᏍᏛᎢ ᎥᏙᎲᎢ
  \resources\PBR_ErrorNoRecoveryEnv_Desc\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎦᏘᏅᏗᏍᏗ ᏣᏤᎵᎢ Windows ᏛᎦᏘᏅᏛᏍᎬᎢ ᎠᎴᏱᎩ ᏙᏗᎩᏍᏗᎢ ᏗᎦᏃᏣᎳᏅᎢ, ᎠᎴ ᎢᎠᏂᎩᏍᏙᏗ ᏣᏤᎵᎢ PC ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᎦᏃᏣᎳᏅᎢ ᎬᏗ.
  \resources\PBR_ErrorNoPayload_Desc\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: No download available. Try again and select the local reinstall option.
  \resources\PBR_ErrorNoPayloadSupport_Desc\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: This recovery scenario does not support the cloud download option. Try again and select the local reinstall option.
  \resources\PBR_ErrorNoDeownlevelEnv_Desc\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎢᏳᏃ ᏱᏣᎭ ᎾᏍᎩ Windows ᎦᏘᏅᏗᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᎴᏱᎩ ᎢᎠᎩᏏᏍᎩ ᏗᎦᏃᏣᎳᏅᎢ, ᎦᏘᏅᏗᏍᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎢᎠᏂᎩᏍᏙᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ PC ᏂᏛᏓᎴᏂᏍᎩ ᎥᎿᎾᏂ ᏗᎦᏃᏣᎳᏅᎢ.
  \resources\PBR_ErrorInsufficientSpace_Line3\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: • ᏙᎦᏘᏅᏕᏍᏗ ᏚᏙᏢᏒᎢ
  \resources\PBR_ErrorInsufficientSpace_Line2\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: • ᏗᏟᎶᏍᏙᏗ ᏗᏣᏤᎵᎢ ᏓᏍᏆᏂᎪᏛᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎥᎿ ᏙᏱᏗᏜ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᏂ ᎠᎴ ᏗᏍᎪᎸᏗᏍᏗ ᎯᎠ PC
  \resources\PBR_ErrorInsufficientSpace_Line1\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: • ᎠᏂᎩᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᏠᏗ ᎦᏅᎦᎵᏍᎩ
  \resources\PBR_ErrorInsufficientSpace_Line0\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᎦᎳᏅᏗᏍᏗᎢ, ᎾᏍᎩ ᏱᏅᏛᎦ:
  \resources\PBR_ErrorInsufficientSpace_Header:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏗᏠᏯᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᎠᏠᏗ ᎤᏟᏅᏗ ᎧᏂᎬᎦ
  \resources\PBR_ErrorInsufficientSpace_Desc:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏠᏯᏍᏔᏅᎢ %1!ws! ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᏱᎩ ᎠᏎᏭ ᎠᏠᏗ ᎤᏟᏅᏛᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏥᎧᏂᎬᎦ (%2!ws!).
  \resources\PBR_ErrorFileNotTrust_Desc\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Required files are not trusted. The files' certificate may have expired or the files might be modified by others.
  \resources\PBR_ErrorDisabled_Desc\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏣᏤᎵᎢ ᏚᏙᏢᏒᎢ ᏗᏍᏓᏩᏛᏍᏗ ᎥᏝ ᏯᎵᏍᎪᏟᏗᎭ. ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᎤᎪᏗ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏗ ᏲᏚᎵᎭ, ᎯᎵᏃᎮᏙᏗᏃ ᏣᏤᎵᎢ ᏏᏴᏫ ᎡᏣᎫᏍᏓᎢ ᎠᎴᏱᎩ IT ᎤᎾᏙᏢᏒᎢ.
  \resources\PBR_ErrorCloud_Header:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: There was a problem downloading
  \resources\PBR_ErrorCant_Header:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎥᏝ ᏱᎬᏥᎧᎯᏴᎾ ᎯᎠ PC
  \resources\PBR_DataWarning_Format:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Cloud download can use more than 4 GB of data.
  \resources\PBR_DataDriveList_Header:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏗᎯᎸᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᏐᏅᏅᎢ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ
  \resources\PBR_DataDriveList_Desc\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎢᏳᏃ ᏱᏣᏚᎵᎠ ᏗᏣᎲᏍᏗᎢ ᏓᏍᏆᏂᎪᏛᎢ ᎥᎿ ᏂᎦᏓ ᏗᏱᎸᏍᏗᎢ, ᎯᎠᏃ ᏗᏱᎸᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᏕᏱᏙᏛᏅᎢ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ:
  \resources\PBR_ConfirmReset_NoApps\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: • ᏗᎲᏍᏗ ᏂᎦᏓ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ ᏚᏙᏢᏒᎢ
  \resources\PBR_ConfirmReset_Line3\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: • ᎯᎲᎾ ᏂᎦᎥ ᏕᎦᏁᏟᏴᏓ ᏂᏚᏩᏁᎸ ᎥᎿ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ
  \resources\PBR_ConfirmReset_Line2\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: • ᎯᎲᎾ ᏂᎦᎥ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ ᏚᏙᏢᏒᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ Ꮭ ᏱᎦᎷᎩ ᏳᏠᏯᏍᏗ ᎯᎠ PC
  \resources\PBR_ConfirmReset_Line1\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: • ᏗᎲᏍᏗ ᏂᎦᏓ ᏗᏣᏤᎵᎢ ᏓᏍᏆᏂᎪᏛᎢ ᎠᎴ ᎬᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏗ ᎾᎿ ᎯᎠ PC
  \resources\PBR_ConfirmReset_Line0\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏛᎦᎧᎯᏴᏍᎬᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ:
  \resources\PBR_ConfirmRefresh_RemovedAppsList\Content:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: View apps that will be removed
  \resources\PBR_ConfirmRefresh_NoApps\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: • ᏗᎲᏍᏗ ᏂᎦᏓ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ ᏚᏙᏢᏒᎢ
  \resources\PBR_ConfirmRefresh_Line3_Featured\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: • ᏣᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᎣᏩᏌᏊ ᏗᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ
  \resources\PBR_ConfirmRefresh_Line2\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: • ᎯᏁᏟᏴᎾ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎠᏏᎾᎦᏘ ᎥᎿ ᏥᏂᏚᏍᏛᏊ ᎠᏓᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗᏍᎩ
  \resources\PBR_ConfirmRefresh_Line1\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: • ᏗᎲᏍᏗ ᏂᎦᏓ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ ᏚᏙᏢᏒᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ Ꮭ ᏱᎦᎷᎩ ᏳᏠᏯᏍᏗ ᎯᎠ PC
  \resources\PBR_ConfirmRefresh_Line0\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏛᎦᎧᎯᏴᏍᎬᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ:
  \resources\PBR_ConfirmPage_MeteredDataWarning_Format:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: •  Cloud download can use more than %ws of data. Your connection is metered and charges may apply.
  \resources\PBR_ConfirmPage_Header:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎠᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᎢᎦᎪᏗᎢ ᎯᎠ PC
  \resources\PBR_ConfirmPage_Desc\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: •  This will take a while and your PC will restart.
  \resources\PBR_ConfirmPage_DataWarning_Format:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: •  Cloud download can use more than %ws of data.
  \resources\PBR_ConfirmPage_BitlockerSuspended\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: •  BitLocker drive encryption will be temporarily suspended until the process is done.
  \resources\PBR_ConfirmPage_BitlockerOff\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: •  BitLocker drive encryption will be turned off.
  \resources\PBR_BatteryError_Header:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎱᏓᎸᎥᎦ ᏣᏤᎵᎢ PC
  \resources\PBR_BatteryError_Desc\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎥᏝ ᏱᎦᏲᏥᎧᎲᎦ ᏣᏤᎵᎢ PC ᏱᎪᎯᏓ ᎠᎢᏒᎢ ᎠᎾᎦᎵᏍᎩ ᏳᏂᎩᏍᏗᏓ
  \resources\PBR_Advanced_Workplace_Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Delete workplace resources?
  \resources\PBR_Advanced_Workplace_SelectionOn:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: •  Delete provisioning packages from your workplace
  \resources\PBR_Advanced_Workplace_SelectionOff:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: •  Keep provisioning packages from your workplace
  \resources\PBR_Advanced_Workplace_OnDesc:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Delete provisioning packages from your workplace
  \resources\PBR_Advanced_Workplace_OffDesc:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Keep provisioning packages from your workplace
  \resources\PBR_Advanced_WipeData_ToggleOn:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Yes, all drives
  \resources\PBR_Advanced_WipeData_ToggleOff:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: No, only Windows drive
  \resources\PBR_Advanced_WipeData_Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Delete files from all drives?
  \resources\PBR_Advanced_WipeData_SelectionOn:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: •  Delete all files from all drives
  \resources\PBR_Advanced_WipeData_SelectionOff:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: •  Delete all files only from Windows drive
  \resources\PBR_Advanced_WipeData_OnDesc:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Delete all files from all drives. Clean data option will apply to all drives
  \resources\PBR_Advanced_WipeData_OffDesc:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Delete all files only from Windows drive
  \resources\PBR_Advanced_PreinstalledApps_Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Restore preinstalled apps?
  \resources\PBR_Advanced_PreinstalledApps_SelectionOn:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: • ᎪᏢᎯᏐᏗ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏂᏗᎦᎬᏃᎢ ᎯᎠ PC
  \resources\PBR_Advanced_PreinstalledApps_SelectionOff:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: • Ꮭ ᎪᏢᎯᏐᏗ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏂᏗᎦᎬᏃᎢ ᎯᎠ PC
  \resources\PBR_Advanced_PreinstalledApps_OnDesc:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎪᏢᎯᏐᏗ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏂᏗᎦᎬᏃᎢ ᎯᎠ PC
  \resources\PBR_Advanced_PreinstalledApps_OffDesc:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Ꮭ ᎪᏢᎯᏐᏗ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏂᏗᎦᎬᏃᎢ ᎯᎠ PC
  \resources\PBR_Advanced_Header:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎭᏑᏯᎩ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ
  \resources\PBR_Advanced_Esim_Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Delete eSIM profiles?
  \resources\PBR_Advanced_Esim_SelectionOn:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: •  Delete all eSIM profiles for cellular data
  \resources\PBR_Advanced_Esim_SelectionOff:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: •  Keep all eSIM profiles for cellular data
  \resources\PBR_Advanced_Esim_OnDesc:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Delete all eSIM profiles for cellular data
  \resources\PBR_Advanced_Esim_OffDesc:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Keep all eSIM profiles for cellular data
  \resources\PBR_Advanced_Erase_Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Clean data?
  \resources\PBR_Advanced_Erase_SelectionOn:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: •  Remove apps and files. Clean the drive
  \resources\PBR_Advanced_Erase_SelectionOff:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: •  Remove apps and files. Do not clean the drive
  \resources\PBR_Advanced_Erase_OnDesc:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Clean the drive. This may take hours, but will make it harder to recover files
  \resources\PBR_Advanced_Erase_OffDesc:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏗᏣᎲᏍᏗᏭ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ. ᎯᎠ Ꮭ ᎾᎦᏣᏄᎵ, ᎠᏎᏅ ᎠᎦᏲᏟ ᎠᎦᏎᏍᏔᏅᎢ
  \resources\PBR_Advanced_Confirm\Content:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎪᎯᏳᏙᏗ
  \resources\PBR_Advanced_CloudRecovery_Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Download Windows?
  \resources\PBR_Advanced_CloudRecovery_SelectionOn:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: •  Download and reinstall Windows
  \resources\PBR_Advanced_CloudRecovery_SelectionOff:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: • ᎢᎦᏘᏅᏓ Windows ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎯᎠ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ
  \resources\PBR_Advanced_CloudRecovery_OnText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Cloud download
  \resources\PBR_Advanced_CloudRecovery_OnDesc:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Download and reinstall Windows
  \resources\PBR_Advanced_CloudRecovery_OffText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Local reinstall
  \resources\PBR_Advanced_CloudRecovery_OffDesc:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎢᎦᏘᏅᏓ Windows ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎯᎠ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ
  \resources\PBR_Advanced_CloudRecovery_Header:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: How would you like to reinstall Windows?
  \resources\PBR_Advanced_CloudRecovery_DisabledDesc:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Make sure you are connected to the internet and try again
  \resources\Password:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏙᏗ ᎥᎧᏁᎬᎢ
  \resources\Ok:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎰᏩ
  \resources\No_GoBack:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Ꮭ, ᏥᎭᏔᎲᎾ
  \resources\No:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎥᏝ
  \resources\NLA_Enable_HeaderText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎠᎵᏍᎪᏟᏙᏗ ᏗᎫᏓᎸᏗᎢ ᏌᏉ ᏫᎫᏓᎸᏗᎢ ᎬᏗ ᎤᏩᏂᏕᏍᎩ ᎪᏙᎯᏳᎢᏗᏍᎩ ᎬᏗ?
  \resources\NLA_Enable_BodyText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎯᎠᏃ ᎠᏎᎢ ᎧᏁᎢᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᏥᎩ.
  \resources\NLA_Disable_HeaderText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎠᎵᏍᎪᏟᏙᏗ ᏫᏗᎫᏓᎸᏗᎢ ᏄᏠᏯᏍᏛᎾ ᏧᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎤᏩᏂᏕᏍᎩ ᎠᏙᎯᏳᎢᏗᏍᎩ?
  \resources\NLA_Disable_BodyText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎢᏳᏃ ᎭᎵᏍᎪᏟᏗᏍᎨᏍᏗ ᏄᏠᏯᏍᏛᎾ NLA, ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᎬᏂᎨᏒᎢ ᏅᎬᏁᎲᎾ ᏣᏤᎵᎢ ᎠᎦᏙᎥᎯᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏗᏍᎩ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏰᎵᎢ ᏂᏓᏤᏢᎾ ᎪᎱᏍᏗ ᏱᎬᏩᎵᏍᏙᏗ.
  \resources\Next:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏐᎢ
  \resources\ManageExclusion_SAVE_FAIL_ErrorText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎮᎦᏍᏓᎭ, ᎠᎨᎩᏗᎯ Ꮭ ᏱᎪᎵᏏᏂᏓ.
  \resources\ManageExclusion_Process_ADD_FAIL_ErrorText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏚᏙᎥ ᎠᎵᏱᎵᏒ Ꮭ ᎯᎠ ᎢᏳᏍᏗ ᏱᏗᎬᏩᏠᏯᏍᏗ ᏕᎪᏪᎸ ᏂᏚᏍᏛᎢ: /"<>|?*   
  \resources\ManageExclusion_Extension_ADD_FAIL_ErrorText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᎪᏯᏅᎯᏗᏍᎩ Ꮭ ᎯᎠ ᎢᏳᏍᏗ ᏱᏗᎬᏩᏠᏯᏍᏗ ᏕᎪᏪᎸ ᏂᏚᏍᏛᎢ: \ /:"<>|?*
  \resources\ManageExclusion_BodyText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎠᏱᏙᏗᎢ ᎢᏤᎢ ᏗᎦᎴᏅᏗᏍᎩ. 
  \resources\ManageExclusion_AuthBodyText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎠᏴᏍᏗᎢ ᏣᏤᎵᎢ ᎢᎬᎾᏕᎾ ᏫᎦᎷᎩ ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏗᎢ ᎧᏃᎮᏍᎩ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏕᎳᎰᎯᏍᏗᎢ ᏙᏳ ᎡᏣᎵᏍᎪᏟᏓᏁᎸᎢ ᏱᎩ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏣᎦᏎᏍᏙᏗᎢ ᏗᎦᎴᏅᏗᏍᎩ. 
  \resources\ManageExclusion_ADD_FAIL_EmptyText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏗᏍᎩ ᎦᏐᏝᏅᎢ ᎥᏝ ᎤᏏᏩ ᏱᏂᎬᏰᎬᎦ ᎠᎴᏱᎩ ᎤᏁᎬ ᏚᏟᏅᏛᎢ ᎤᏩᏌ ᎠᏍᏗ 
  \resources\Lockdown_SignOutWarningText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎠᏑᏰᏓ ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏗ ᏕᏣᏙᎥ ᎰᏪᎸᎦ, ᎠᏎ ᎦᏄᎪᎢᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ ᏥᎰᏪᎸᎦ ᏗᏣᏚᎵ ᏗᎦᏁᏟᏴᏓ. Ꮎ ᎠᏥᏅᏅ ᎠᏴᏍᏙᏗ ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏗ ᎤᏬᏪᎳᏅᎯ ᏥᎩ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏂᏄᎪᎢᏍᏔᏂᏗ.
  \resources\LockdownUser_HeaderText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏌᏑᏯᎩ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏗ
  \resources\LockdownUser_EmptyListText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: The only active account on this device is the current logged in account. Add or create a new account and try again.
  \resources\LockdownApp_HeaderText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎭᏑᏯᎩ ᎯᎠ ᎬᏙᏗ
  \resources\LockdownApp_EmptyListText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎯᎠ ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏗ Ꮭ ᏱᏚᎭ ᏗᎬᏙᏗ. ᎯᏘᏅᎦ ᎡᎷᏊ ᏌᏊ ᎬᏙᏗ ᎥᎿ ᎠᏑᏰᏓ ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏗ ᎠᎴ ᏣᎭᏁᎵᏓ.
  \resources\LeaveDomain_RestartHeaderText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎢᎭᏂᎩᏍᏓ ᏣᏤᎵ PC
  \resources\LeaveDomain_RestartBody_DomainUser_Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏱᏣᏂᎩᏍᏓᎾ, PC Ꮭ ᏱᎦᎵᎪᎲᎦ %1. ᏐᎢ ᏄᏓᎴ ᏣᎵᎪᏅᏓ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏗ, Ꮎ ᎢᏳᏍᏗ ᏥᏴᏍᏙᏓ ᎠᎬᏱ ᎤᎦᏅᏓᏛᎢ.
  \resources\LeaveDomain_RestartBodyText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎣᏂ ᎢᎭᏂᎩᏍᏓᏅ, PC Ꮭ ᏱᎬᎵᎪᎲᎦ %1.
  \resources\LeaveDomain_NonAdmin_Credentials:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏗ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏍᎩ Ꮭ ᏱᏚᎸᏫᏍᏓᏏ. ᎤᏙᎯᏳᏃ ᏣᏅᏖᏍᏗ ᎡᏍᎦᏂ ᏄᎬᏫᏳᏌᏕᎩ ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏗ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏍᎩ ᏦᏪᎵᎠ ᎠᎴ ᏥᎭᏁᎵᏓ.
  \resources\LeaveDomain_NERR_SetupNotJoined:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎯᎠ PC Ꮭ ᏱᏫᎫᏓᎳ ᎢᎬᎾᏕᎾ ᏫᎦᎷᎬ.
  \resources\LeaveDomain_Leave_Domain_Failed:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎪᎱᏍᏗ ᏓᏓᎴᎬᎢ. ᎤᏩᎬᏗᏗᏒ ᏥᎭᏁᎵᏔᏅᎢ.
  \resources\LeaveDomain_Incorrect_Password:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᎥᎧᏁᎬ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏗ Ꮭ ᏱᏚᎸᏫᏍᏓᏏ. ᏫᏣᎦᏛᎲᎦ ᎠᎴ ᏥᎭᏁᎵᏓ.
  \resources\LeaveDomain_ConfirmNextButtonText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎱᏓᎴᎩ
  \resources\LeaveDomain_ConfirmHeaderText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎠᏚᏓᎴᏍᎩ ᎥᎿ ᎤᏓᏡᎬᎢ 
  \resources\LeaveDomain_ConfirmBody_DomainUser_Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: 
      ᏏᏃ ᏂᏧᏓᎴᏓ, ᎠᏎᎢ ᏦᏪᎶᏗ ᏙᏙᎥᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏱᏍᏓᎵᏲᎠ ᏄᎬᏫᏳᏌᏕᎩ ᎠᏚᏓᎸᎥᏍᎩ ᎥᏝ ᎤᏤᎵᎢ ᏱᎩ ᏣᏤᎵᎢ ᎤᏙᏢᏒᎢ, ᎢᏳᏍᏗ ᏣᏤᎵᎢ Microsoft ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏙᏗ .

ᎾᏊ ᏱᏣᏂᎩᏏ ᎥᎿ ᎤᎾᏓᏡᎬᎢ, ᎥᏝ ᏰᎵᎢ ᎦᏦᏪᎶᏗ ᏱᎨᏎᏍᏗ ᏕᏣᏙᎥᎢ ᎥᎿ ᎤᎾᏓᏡᎬᎢ ᏗᎫᏓᎸᏗᎢ ᎾᎿ ᏣᏤᎵᎢ PC.
    
  \resources\LeaveDomain_ConfirmBodyText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎱᏓᎴᏒ, ᏝᏃ ᏱᎦᎯᏴᏍᏓ ᎥᎿ PC ᎥᎿ ᏣᏓᏡᎬ ᎠᏚᏓᎵ.

ᎯᎠ PC ᎤᎭ Bitlocker ᎦᏘᏅᏅ ᎠᎴ ᎠᎢ, ᏣᎾᎡᏍᏗ ᎦᎴᏂᏓᏅ Ꮎ BitLocker ᎠᏩᏛᏙᏗ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏗ Ꮲ ᎠᏎᏃ ᎨᏒ ᎯᎠ PC.
  \resources\LeaveDomain_AuthBodyTitle:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎯᏴᏍᏓ ᏔᎵᏁ ᎠᏑᏰᏓ ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏗ ᎧᏃᎮᏍᎩ
  \resources\LeaveDomain_AuthBodyText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎣᏍᏓ ᎭᎦᏎᏍᏓ Ꮎ ᎡᎷᏊ ᏲᏪᎸᎦ ᎥᎿ PC ᎣᏂ ᏳᏓᎴᏍᎩ ᏧᎶᏒ ᎤᎾᏓᏡᎬ, ᎯᏴᏍᏓ ᏕᏣᏙᎥᎢ ᎥᎿ ᎡᏍᎦᎾ ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏗ. ᎡᎷᏊ Microsoft ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏗ ᏱᎩ ᎠᎴᏱᎩ ᎡᏍᎦᎾ ᏍᏚᏓᎸᏓ. ᏂᏣᎲᎾ ᏌᏊ, ᏦᏢᏅᏓ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ.
  \resources\JoinDomain_RPC_S_SERVER_UNAVAILABLE:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎥᏝᏃ ᏱᏫᎦᎫᏓᎸᎦ ᎢᎬᎾᏕᎾ ᏫᎦᎷᎬ ᏃᏊ ᎨᏒ. ᏙᏳᏃ ᏣᏅᏖᏍᏗ ᏥᏫᏧᏓᎳ ᏗᏣᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏗ ᎤᎾᏚᏓᎵ ᎠᎴ ᏥᎭᏁᎵᏓ.
  \resources\JoinDomain_RPC_S_CALL_IN_PROGRESS:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎯᎠ PC ᎦᏳᎳ ᏫᎫᏓᎸᎥᏍᎦ ᎢᎬᎾᏕᎾ ᏫᎦᎷᎬᎢ. ᏥᎭᏂᎩᏍᏓ ᏣᏤᎵ PC ᎠᎴ ᏥᎭᏁᎵᏓ.
  \resources\JoinDomain_RestartPCHeaderText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏥᎭᏂᎩᏍᏓ ᏣᏤᎵ PC
  \resources\JoinDomain_NERR_SetupAlreadyJoined:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎯᎠ PC ᎦᏳᎳ ᎠᏖᎳᏓ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎢᎬᎾᏕᎾ ᏫᎦᎷᎬ.
  \resources\JoinDomain_HeaderText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎢᎬᎾᏕᎾ ᏫᎦᎷᎬ ᎭᏖᎳᏓ
  \resources\JoinDomain_ERROR_NO_SUCH_MEMBER:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᎢᎬᎾᏕᎾ ᏫᎦᎷᎬ ᏚᏙᎥ Ꮭ ᏱᎬᏩᏔ. ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏗ ᏚᏙᎥ ᏫᏣᎦᏛᎲᎦ ᎠᎴ ᏥᎭᏁᎵᏓ.
  \resources\JoinDomain_ERROR_MEMBER_IN_ALIAS:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎯᎠ ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏗ ᎦᏳᎳ ᎦᎧᎭ ᎠᎭᏂ PC.
  \resources\JoinDomain_ERROR_INVALID_DOMAIN:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᎢᎬᎾᏕᎾ ᏫᎦᎷᎬ Ꮭ ᏱᎬᏩᏔ. ᎢᎬᎾᏕᎾ ᏫᎦᎷᎬ ᏚᏙᎥ ᏫᏣᎦᏛᎲᎦ ᎠᎴ ᏥᎭᏁᎵᏓ.
  \resources\JoinDomain_ERROR_DUP_NAME:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎯᎠ PC ᏚᏙᎥ ᎦᏳᎳ ᎠᎬᏗᎭ. ᏄᏓᎴ PC ᏚᏙᎥ ᎭᏑᏯᎩ ᎠᎴ ᏥᎭᏁᎵᏓ.
  \resources\JoinDomain_ERROR_ACCESS_DENIED:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Ꮭ ᏱᎬᏖᎳᏓ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎢᎬᎾᏕᎾ ᏫᎦᎷᎬ. ᏙᏳ ᏣᏅᏖᏍᏗ ᎡᏣᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎭ ᏣᏖᎳᏗᏍᏗᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎢᎬᎾᏕᎾ ᏫᎦᎷᎬ, ᏃᏊᎴ ᎭᏑᏯᎩ ᏄᏓᎴ PC ᏚᏙᎥ ᎠᎴ ᎢᎭᏁᎵᏓ.
  \resources\JoinDomain_DomainNameDescriptionText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎢᎬᎾᏕᎾ ᏫᎦᎷᎬ ᏚᏙᎥᎢ
  \resources\JoinDomain_ConfirmBodyText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎢᎭᏂᎩᏒᎢ, ᏣᏤᎵ PC ᏛᎵᎪᏓᏁᎵ ᎯᎠ ᎢᎬᎾᏕᎾ ᏫᎦᎷᎬ: 
  \resources\JoinDomain_CANNOT_JOIN_ERROR:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Ꮭ ᏱᎬᏖᎳᏓ ᎯᎠ ᎢᎬᎾᏕᎾ ᏫᎦᎷᎬ. ᏣᏤᎵᎢᏃ IT ᏄᏂᎬᏫᏚᏌᏕᎩ ᎦᎯᎵᏃᎮᏓ ᎤᎪᏕᏍᏗ ᎠᏕᎶᎰᎯᏍᏗᎢ.
  \resources\JoinDomain_AuthHeaderText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎾᎿ ᎢᎬᎾᏕᎾ ᏫᎦᎷᎬ ᏕᏣᏙᎥ ᎰᏪᎸᎥᎦ
  \resources\JoinDomain_AuthBodyText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎢᎬᎾᏕᎾ ᏫᎦᎷᎬ ᎧᏃᎮᏢᏍᎩ ᎰᏪᎸᎥᎦ ᏦᎯᏳᏙᏗᎢ ᏤᏣᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎭ ᏫᏧᏓᎸᏗᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎢᎬᎾᏕᎾ ᏫᎦᎷᎬᎢ.
  \resources\JoinDomain_ADD_LOCAL_USER_FAILED:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎪᎱᏍᏗ ᏓᏓᎴᎬᎢ. ᎤᏩᎬᏗᏗᏒ ᏥᎭᏁᎵᏔᏅᎢ.
  \resources\JoinDomain_AddDomainUserHeaderText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎧᏁᏉᏍᏗ ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏗ
  \resources\JoinDomain_AddDomainUserGroupText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏗ ᎢᏳᏍᏗ
  \resources\JoinDomain_AddDomainUserBodyText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎰᏪᎸᎥᎦ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏗ ᎧᎣᎮᏢᏍᎩ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᎠᏥᏃᎮᏢᏍᎩ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ ᏥᎬᏗᏍᎨᏍᏗ ᎯᎠ PC. ᎢᏳᏃ ᏱᏃᎯᏯ ᎯᎠ ᎠᎳᏍᎬᏗ, ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᏴᏫ ᏗᏓᎵᏍᎪᎸᏓᏁᎯ ᏗᏓᏁᏟᏴᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎤᎮᏍᏗ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎢᎬᎾᏕᎾ ᏫᎦᎷᎬ ᎤᎬᏩᏟ.
  \resources\JoinDomain_AddDomainUserAccountText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎬᏗᏍᎩ ᎠᏚᏓᎸᏗ
  \resources\InPlaceUpgrade_Title:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Fix problems using Windows Update
  \resources\InPlaceUpgrade_Header:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: We'll repair components and system files
  \resources\InPlaceUpgrade_ExpeditedSessionCheckBox:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Automatically restart my PC 15 minutes after installation
  \resources\InPlaceUpgrade_BodyText2\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Please make sure your PC is on and connected to the network and a power source. After installation, we'll let you know when it's time to restart your PC to complete the repair.
  \resources\InPlaceUpgrade_BodyText1\Text:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: If a repair solution is available, we'll attempt to fix system component corruption by reinstalling the current version of Windows. Your apps, documents, and settings will be preserved.
  \resources\HolographicUninstall_SucceededHeaderText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎯᏘᏅᏔᎩᏍᎬ ᎢᏳᎵᏍᏙᏗ ᏅᎵᏍᏔᏅᎩ
  \resources\HolographicUninstall_SucceededBodyText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Windows Mixed Reality ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᏂᎲᏒᎩ.
  \resources\HolographicUninstall_RestartHeaderText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎠᏂᎩᏍᏙᏓ ᎠᏎᏯᏛᏗ
  \resources\HolographicUninstall_RestartBodyText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎠᎦᏙᎥᎯᏍᏗ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏗᏍᎩ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎢᏣᏂᏱᏍᏙᏗ Ꮎ ᎤᏍᏆᏗᏍᏗ ᎦᏘᏅᏕᏍᎬᎩ Windows Mixed Reality.
  \resources\HolographicUninstall_LearnMoreText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎤᏟ ᎢᎦᎢ ᎠᏕᎶᏆᏍᏗ
  \resources\HolographicUninstall_HeaderText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Windows Mixed Reality ᎦᏘᏅᏕᏍᎬᎩ
  \resources\HolographicUninstall_ErrorText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Windows Mixed Reality ᏃᏨᏱᏍᎬ ᎣᎩᏄᎸᎲᎦ ᎣᎩᏍᏆᏗᏍᏗ. ᎡᎵᏊ ᏏᏊ ᎢᎦᏓ ᏧᎵᎪᎯ ᏗᏍᏆᏂᎪᏙᏗ ᎠᎴ ᎠᏓᏃᎯᏎᎯ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎠᎦᏙᎥᎯᏍᏗ ᎠᏍᏆᏂᎪᏗᏍᎩ.
  \resources\HolographicUninstall_BodyText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Windows Mixed Reality ᎯᎠ ᏱᏂᎬᎾᏕᎦ.
  \resources\GetHelp:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎠᎵᏍᏕᎵᏍᎩ ᏫᎦ
